# AI Engineering Preflight

Follow `AGENTS.md` and `docs/ai-preflight/` for this repository.

Before code changes:

- read relevant files;
- identify public entry points and internal helpers;
- identify side effects;
- plan before large edits;
- keep changes small;
- verify with tests/lint/typecheck/build where available;
- report checks run, checks not run, assumptions, and risks.

Use modular encapsulation. Do not reach into internals from outside modules.
